WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:15.920
We've never done a project where we could&nbsp;
see such a huge impact on the clients.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.840
So individuals who are faced with mental health&nbsp;
challenges or economic challenges, having them try&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:29.840
to navigate all of these disparate systems, how&nbsp;
do we improve that process and that experience?

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:43.680
IBM solution really allowed for secured access to&nbsp;
the data that's all protected in our data center&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:47.840
from the cloud. What the IBM&nbsp;
product is bringing to the team&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:52.720
an ability for them to really care&nbsp;
coordinate, have a holistic view,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:58.000
and then be able to set goals and manage&nbsp;
their cases right in that technology. With&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.240
Watson in the cloud we can actually engage and&nbsp;
interact with our clients anywhere, at any time.

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:14.640
We could really make a difference. We could&nbsp;
not only serve this population better,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:21.040
we could also save money while we're doing&nbsp;
it. This system can be used for any number&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:27.040
of individuals or cohorts of individuals. It is&nbsp;
a blueprint for how we're going to provide care&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:30.480
across the county. Bringing&nbsp;
this technology to government&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:39.840
is really revolutionizing and transforming&nbsp;
the way that government does work.

